# Product

EnergyOS is a Swiss B2B assessment platform for commercial and residential properties.

The workflow is address, building, roof, consumption, PV, battery, tariff, finance, dashboard, and PDF. Implement a step only when the task names it.

Do not add heat pumps, EV charging, energy trading, IoT, machine learning, portfolio optimization, or countries other than Switzerland.
